The '''Atoned Champion''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|Slayer Miniboss}} for the [[Zombie Slayer]].

== Spawning == 
It has a small chance to be spawned when a player with an active {{MobSprite|Revenant Horror}} {{SlayerTier|V}} Quest kills any [[Zombie]] outside of Dungeons. When this happens, an explosion effect takes place, and the Atoned Champion will spawn. 

